    "summary": {
      "en": "Dungeon Maps Likely Not Coming to WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "Es probable que Mazmorra Maps no llegue a WoW: Forever..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ac7ee355b1881.71447694\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Dungeon maps are probably not coming to World of Warcraft: Forever due to design philosophies.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/the-wow-forever-podcast-episode-3-now-available-dungeons-and-questing-383309\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">WoW: Forever Podcast - Ep. 3</span></a></div><br><br>In today's <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/the-wow-forever-podcast-episode-3-now-available-dungeons-and-questing-383309\" data-contiguous=\"true\">episode of The WoW Forever Podcast</a>, the panel discussed Dungeon Maps. Amongst the community, some players have requested dungeon maps so that they can more easily explore the dungeon and complete the dungeon faster, while others enjoy the sense of exploration. Jay Hartman, Senior Game Designer, comments on dungeon maps and their philosophy:<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"user\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Jay Hartman<span class=\"quote-said-text\"> said: </span></div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">You mentioned dungeon maps. I think I've seen a couple questions and comments about it, and I think this philosophy that we have reinforces why we don't have dungeon maps. We want you to feel like it's an adventure and it's threatening and we want you to explore those nooks and crannies. If you have a dungeon map, people find the shortest route possible and try to avoid stuff. We want to try to incentivize you to go explore [...] This is a good reason of why we probably won't have dungeon maps because of all of these things.</div></div>From this, it seems like Dungeon maps will not be coming to WoW: Forever anytime soon. After the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/buffs-to-dungeon-experience-coming-in-wow-forever-383312\" data-contiguous=\"true\">buffs to dungeon experience</a>, it'll be interesting to see if players are still requesting dungeon maps to be added.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Dungeon maps are probably not coming to World of Warcraft: Forever due to design philosophies.<br /><br />WoW: Forever Podcast - Ep. 3<br /><br />In today's <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/the-wow-forever-podcast-episode-3-now-available-dungeons-and-questing-383309\">episode of The WoW Forever Podcast</a>, the panel discussed Dungeon Maps. Amongst the community, some players have requested dungeon maps so that they can more easily explore the dungeon and complete the dungeon faster, while others enjoy the sense of exploration. Jay Hartman, Senior Game Designer, comments on dungeon maps and their philosophy:<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\"><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Jay Hartman</h2>You mentioned dungeon maps. I think I've seen a couple questions and comments about it, and I think this philosophy that we have reinforces why we don't have dungeon maps. We want you to feel like it's an adventure and it's threatening and we want you to explore those nooks and crannies. If you have a dungeon map, people find the shortest route possible and try to avoid stuff. We want to try to incentivize you to go explore This is a good reason of why we probably won't have dungeon maps because of all of these things.</div><br /><br />From this, it seems like Dungeon maps will not be coming to WoW: Forever anytime soon. After the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/buffs-to-dungeon-experience-coming-in-wow-forever-383312\">buffs to dungeon experience</a>, it'll be interesting to see if players are still requesting dungeon maps to be added.</noscript>            \n        ",
