    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ac7ee54b35f47.28024265\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has released Episode 3 of the WoW: Forever podcast and this week they're discussing dungeons and questing!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LwOWAf06YPg/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><br><br>This week, special guests include:<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Jay Hartman, Encounter Designer</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Rowan Ryder, Encounter Designer</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@hammerdancegaming\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Hammer Dance Gaming</a></div></li></ul>Some of the largest topics include:<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/dungeon-maps-likely-not-coming-to-wow-forever-383317\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Dungeon Maps Likely Not Coming</a></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/buffs-to-dungeon-experience-coming-in-wow-forever-383312\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Buffs to Dungeon Experience are Coming</a></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/2-100-gold-buying-accounts-have-been-banned-on-wow-forever-beta-383310\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Over 2,100 Gold Buying accounts have been banned</a></div></li></ul><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-source=\"false\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-header\"><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Join Host ‪Countdown to Classic‬, Senior Game Designers Josh “Aggrend” Greenfield, Jay Hartman, and Rowan Ryder, plus special guest ‪Hammer Dance Gaming for a deep dive discussion breaking down WoW: Forever’s dungeons and other relevant news related to the Beta.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has released Episode 3 of the WoW: Forever podcast and this week they're discussing dungeons and questing!<br /><br />This week, special guests include:<br /><ul><li>Jay Hartman, Encounter Designer</li><li>Rowan Ryder, Encounter Designer</li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@hammerdancegaming\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hammer Dance Gaming</a></li></ul><br /><br />Some of the largest topics include:<br /><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/dungeon-maps-likely-not-coming-to-wow-forever-383317\">Dungeon Maps Likely Not Coming</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/buffs-to-dungeon-experience-coming-in-wow-forever-383312\">Buffs to Dungeon Experience are Coming</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/2-100-gold-buying-accounts-have-been-banned-on-wow-forever-beta-383310\">Over 2,100 Gold Buying accounts have been banned</a></li></ul><br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">Join Host ‪Countdown to Classic‬, Senior Game Designers Josh “Aggrend” Greenfield, Jay Hartman, and Rowan Ryder, plus special guest ‪Hammer Dance Gaming for a deep dive discussion breaking down WoW: Forever’s dungeons and other relevant news related to the Beta. </div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
